message: "If you use d-ffreX in your research, please cite it using the following information."
type: software
title: "d-ffreX"
authors:
  - given-names: "Samanta"
    family-names: "Pérez Arévalo"
  - given-names: "Jesús"
    family-names: "Delgado Aguillón"
  - given-names: "José"
    family-names: "Reyes Gasga"
