    family-names: "Valdez Valenzuela"
abstract: >
  d-ffreX is a graphical user interface designed for crystallographers, microscopists,
  materials scientists, and students to facilitate the indexing and
  analysis of electron diffraction patterns (EDP) and fast Fourier
  transforms (FFT), and their comparison with X-ray diffraction (XRD)
  reference cards. The program considers kinematical electron diffraction.
keywords:
  - Electron diffraction
  - Transmission electron microscopy
  - Crystallography
  - X-ray diffraction
  - Materials characterization
version: "1.0.0"
